# ACL Mosquitto cible pour une station de recharge.
#
# Principes :
# - le backend lit la supervision complète et peut publier des commandes de diagnostic ;
# - le Raspberry publie les commandes physiques et lit les ACK ESP32 ;
# - chaque ESP32 ne lit/écrit que les topics de son propre emplacement ;
# - les comptes esp32_slotX restent disponibles pour les tests locaux historiques ;
# - les comptes esp32_station_demo_borne_1_slotX illustrent le modèle production
#   station/borne/emplacement.

user station_backend
topic readwrite station/health
topic read station/#
topic write station/+/cmd
topic write station/+/+/+/cmd
# Autorisé pour le simulateur local lancé côté backend.
topic write station/+/telemetry
topic write station/+/+/+/telemetry

user raspberry_kiosk
topic read station/+/ack
topic read station/+/+/+/ack
topic write station/+/cmd
topic write station/+/+/+/cmd

# Comptes ESP32 de développement local : station/slotX/...
user esp32_slot1
topic read station/slot1/cmd
topic write station/slot1/telemetry
topic write station/slot1/status
topic write station/slot1/alert
topic write station/slot1/ack

user esp32_slot2
topic read station/slot2/cmd
topic write station/slot2/telemetry
topic write station/slot2/status
topic write station/slot2/alert
topic write station/slot2/ack

user esp32_slot3
topic read station/slot3/cmd
topic write station/slot3/telemetry
topic write station/slot3/status
topic write station/slot3/alert
topic write station/slot3/ack

# Comptes ESP32 production de démonstration : station/<mqtt_prefix>/slotX/...
user esp32_station_demo_borne_1_slot1
topic read station/station-demo/borne-1/slot1/cmd
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot1/telemetry
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot1/status
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot1/alert
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot1/ack

user esp32_station_demo_borne_1_slot2
topic read station/station-demo/borne-1/slot2/cmd
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot2/telemetry
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot2/status
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot2/alert
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot2/ack

user esp32_station_demo_borne_1_slot3
topic read station/station-demo/borne-1/slot3/cmd
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot3/telemetry
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot3/status
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot3/alert
topic write station/station-demo/borne-1/slot3/ack
